  "assumptions": [
    "LOCAL opt-in native Linux loader required; ordinary browser compiler remains unavailable.",
    "Only canonical accelerometer and wifi use existing runtime kits; remaining physical silicon/passives use the existing reduced power plant, not 50 silicon models.",
    "ESP32-C3 ESP-AT is a behavioral byte-stream peer; no ESP firmware or RF simulation. EN/strap/reset timing and accelerometer interrupt pins are not modeled by this projection.",
    "Raw basket.power.rail_5v represents carrier VBUS; later loader maps it to a distinct disclosed synthetic execution-supply proxy, never silicon CPU VDD.",
    "Raw basket.power.rail_3v3 gates external3v3 at functional 2.7 V; pinmux/clock/electrical waveforms are not simulated.",
    "Load schedule is explicit from circuit attrs; radio idle initially, burst only by explicit intervention; no load inferred from mock connection state.",
    "One persistent battery plant, 100 ms steps; fault recovery needs explicit healthy latch-reset intervention, no plant restart or time rewind."
  ]
